                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase">
                            Vimala Sanouvong
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-base sm:text-xl font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 pt-1 leading-relaxed">
