                            ພາກວິຊາ ໄອທີ (IT) • ແຂວງຄຳມ່ວນ
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Personal Motto Banner -->
                    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto lg:mx-0 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-orange-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-md shadow-amber-500/20">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-lg"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-left">
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400 block">ຄຳຄົມປະຈຳຕົວ</span>
                            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 dark:from-amber-300 dark:to-orange-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                                “ ສູ້ຕໍ່ໄປ ”
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Quick Action Buttons -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-2">
                        <a href="#contact" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-violet-600 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-violet-500 text-white font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 hover:shadow-indigo-600/45 transition-all flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
                            ຕິດຕໍ່ຂ້ອຍ
                        </a>
                        <a href="#about" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 font-semibold border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card text-indigo-500 dark:text-cyan-400"></i>
                            ຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນຕົວ
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Profile Card with Glowing Frame & Live Upload Preview -->
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center">
                    <div class="relative p-5 rounded-3xl bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl animate-float">
                        <!-- Ambient Glow Behind Frame -->
                        <div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500 via-violet-500 to-cyan-400 opacity-30 blur-xl -z-10"></div>
                        
                        <!-- Rounded-Square Glowing Profile Frame -->
                        <div class="relative w-60 h-60 sm:w-72 sm:h-72 rounded-2xl p-1.5 bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500 via-violet-500 to-cyan-400 shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 relative">
                                <!-- 
                                    Default image loads ./profile.jpg for GitHub Pages.
                                    Fallback inline SVG avatar renders cleanly if profile.jpg is not present yet.
                                -->
                                <img 
                                    id="profile-preview" 
                                    src="./profile.jpg" 
                                    alt="ຮູບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ນ. ວິມາລາ ສານຸວົງ"
                                    class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                                    onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='data:image/svg+xml;utf8,' + encodeURIComponent(`<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 400 400'><defs><linearGradient id='bg' x1='0%' y1='0%' x2='100%' y2='100%'><stop offset='0%' stop-color='%231e1b4b'/><stop offset='50%' stop-color='%23312e81'/><stop offset='100%' stop-color='%230e7490'/></linearGradient><linearGradient id='shirt' x1='0%' y1='0%' x2='100%' y2='0%'><stop offset='0%' stop-color='%236366f1'/><stop offset='100%' stop-color='%2306b6d4'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='400' height='400' fill='url(%23bg)'/><circle cx='200' cy='155' r='85' fill='%231e293b'/><path d='M115 160 C115 90, 285 90, 285 160 L295 270 C295 280, 105 280, 105 270 Z' fill='%230f172a'/><path d='M100 370 C100 295, 300 295, 300 370 L310 400 L90 400 Z' fill='url(%23shirt)'/><rect x='182' y='225' width='36' height='45' rx='16' fill='%23fed7aa'/><circle cx='200' cy='175' r='58' fill='%23ffedd5'/><path d='M142 165 C145 110, 255 110, 258 165 C240 135, 195 130, 175 152 C160 138, 148 150, 142 165 Z' fill='%230f172a'/><circle cx='180' cy='175' r='5.5' fill='%231e293b'/><circle cx='220' cy='175' r='5.5' fill='%231e293b'/><circle cx='182' cy='173' r='2' fill='%23ffffff'/><circle cx='222' cy='173' r='2' fill='%23ffffff'/><path d='M188 198 Q200 210 212 198' stroke='%23e11d48' stroke-width='4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='165' cy='188' r='8' fill='%23fda4af' opacity='0.6'/><circle cx='235' cy='188' r='8' fill='%23fda4af' opacity='0.6'/><rect x='135' y='315' width='130' height='75' rx='10' fill='%23cbd5e1'/><circle cx='200' cy='352' r='10' fill='%236366f1'/></svg>`);"
                                >
