                                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-800/80 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-700/60">Computer Skills</span>
                            </div>
