                    <div class="space-y-3">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/15 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">ທີ່ຢູ່</span>
                            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                                ບ້ານ ແຕນ, ເມືອງ ມະຫາໄຊ, ແຂວງ ຄຳມ່ວນ
                            </h3>
